wordlists/unjumble_dictionary.txt is derived from Monkeytype's english_450k word list
(frontend/static/languages/english_450k.json, GPL-3.0), the ENABLE word list (Enhanced
North American Benchmark LExicon, public domain) and english and english_1k, by
