The web frontend (web/) adapts Monkeytype's look (GPL-3.0): theme colour data
(web/src/themes/themes.json, extracted by web/scripts/build-themes.mjs) and CSS
for buttons, inputs, words and the caret. It bundles Roboto Mono via
@fontsource/roboto-mono (SIL OFL 1.1) and Font Awesome Free (icons CC BY 4.0,
fonts SIL OFL 1.1, code MIT).
